      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793726643567,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> In LLD we can talk about the functionallity parts\n    how this function will work \n-> In these part we can do coding ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> In LLD we can talk about the functionallity parts\n    how this function will work \n-> In these part we can do coding ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZP_gZKmRq5rwn9GXRxrGv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2079.4722852480413,
      "y": 869.4558249882634,
      "width": 401.41973876953125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ab",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1503656654,
      "version": 41,
      "versionNonce": 1409357006,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793726690274,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In HLD there have 9 points we can check",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In HLD there have 9 points we can check",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OXlJwZkPFKL9tGAWYOtu8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2160.470123144314,
      "y": 927.8326256152734,
      "width": 805.6394653320312,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ac",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 9021522,
      "version": 1130,
      "versionNonce": 80614482,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793729647138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1> Load/ scalablity:- how you can manage your client \n                            In single time how you can handle req and many more\n\n2> Performance/ Latency:- if any user come then how much time they can\n                                   wait for the response \n\n3> Availibility:- many time app will crached due to some load or some another\n                    problem. we can check abailibility on 99% , 99.9%, 99.99%\n                    99.999%\n\n         In 365 days -> your app will avalible 99% of 365 days\n    no one give 100% because some problem will come \n\n4> Reliability / fault tolerancee:- behave correctly and if one machine down \n                                    then another machine working properly\n\n5> consistency:- every one see same and correct data\n\n6> Durability:- if you store any data then it important have all the data safe\n\n7> Security\n\n8> Cost\n\n9> Maintability:- it mainly tell about the coding part easily understrand and modify\n                     (mostly we cover this thing in LLD parts)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1> Load/ scalablity:- how you can manage your client \n                            In single time how you can handle req and many more\n\n2> Performance/ Latency:- if any user come then how much time they can\n                                   wait for the response \n\n3> Availibility:- many time app will crached due to some load or some another\n                    problem. we can check abailibility on 99% , 99.9%, 99.99%\n                    99.999%\n\n         In 365 days -> your app will avalible 99% of 365 days\n    no one give 100% because some problem will come \n\n4> Reliability / fault tolerancee:- behave correctly and if one machine down \n                                    then another machine working properly\n\n5> consistency:- every one see same and correct data\n\n6> Durability:- if you store any data then it important have all the data safe\n\n7> Security\n\n8> Cost\n\n9> Maintability:- it mainly tell about the coding part easily understrand and modify\n                     (mostly we cover this thing in LLD parts)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "o_ywFh3UeJe6sFJFqQ77d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2038.3923144364485,
      "y": 1733.2162638953196,
      "width": 872.0394287109375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 309722254,
      "version": 225,
      "versionNonce": 1149392718,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793729793339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One important point you can't tell we make all 9 point best\nyou can check your need then we can see which part is important for you based on that \nyou make your applications",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "One important point you can't tell we make all 9 point best\nyou can check your need then we can see which part is important for you based on that \nyou make your applications",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
